- 无需声明修改：你不必说明你改动了哪些地方。

- No attribution required: you do not have to credit the author, keep this notice, or display any acknowledgment in the UI or docs.
- No copyleft: your modified version may be fully closed source.
- No share-alike: you are not required to keep CC0; you may relicense under anything, including a proprietary license.
- No change disclosure: you do not have to state what you changed.

（可选，非义务）若你愿意，欢迎在文档中保留一句"基于 Guqin JianZiPu Panel Tool 修改"，这只是礼貌，不构成任何法律义务。
