CC0 covers this project's code and documentation only, and does not cover the following third-party components. Verify their licenses yourself:

1. JianZiPu 减字字体 / The JianZiPu font

授权信息 / License: SIL Open Font License 1.1
版权 / Copyright: © 2021–2026 Nancy Yi Liang, Nellodee LLC；部分字形源自 TW-Kai（CNS11643），© 2023 Ministry of Digital Affairs, Taiwan。
© 2021–2026 Nancy Yi Liang, Nellodee LLC; derived in part from TW-Kai (CNS11643), © 2023 Ministry of Digital Affairs, Taiwan.

当前状态 / Current status: 本插件的源代码仅通过字体名引用该字体，当前发布版本不附带、不分发字体文件，用户需自行安装。
The plugin's source code only references the font by name; the current release does not bundle or redistribute the font file. Users install it themselves.

若随附分发 / If bundled with distribution: 若某个发行版将字体文件随插件一起打包分发，须遵守 OFL 1.1，核心条件为：
If a distribution bundles the font file with the plugin, OFL 1.1 applies, with these core conditions:

1) 附带声明：每份副本须附带上述版权声明与 OFL 1.1 许可证文本，可置于独立文件（建议 LICENSE-JianZiPu-OFL.txt）或软件内用户可方便查看处。
   Include the notice: each copy must carry the copyright notice above and the OFL 1.1 license text — as a separate file (suggested: LICENSE-JianZiPu-OFL.txt) or in a place the user can easily view inside the software.
2) 不得单独售卖字体：字体可以随软件捆绑、嵌入、再分发并随软件一起收费，但不得将字体本身单独作为商品出售。
   No selling the font alone: the font may be bundled, embedded, redistributed and sold together with software, but the font itself may not be sold on its own.
3) 修改版改名：若修改字体字形并再分发，修改版不得使用原保留字体名称（Reserved Font Name），除非获得版权持有人书面许可。仅原样打包、不改字形则不涉及此条。
   Rename modified versions: if you modify the glyphs and redistribute, the modified version must not use the original Reserved Font Name without written permission. Bundling unmodified is not affected.

字体文件不属于 CC0 范围；OFL 1.1 的要求只约束字体，不影响本项目代码的 CC0 状态。
The font file is not covered by CC0; OFL 1.1 governs the font only and does not change the CC0 status of this project's code.

