八、许可证选择说明 / A Note on License Choice

CC0 对软件是可用的，且是最"无负担"的选择：使用者无需署名、无需开源、可商用、可闭源。若你日后希望获得更清晰的司法可执行性（部分法域对"放弃著作权"的效力认定不如"授予许可"明确），可考虑改用 MIT 或 Unlicense；但作为一份"完全放开、不打扰使用者"的声明，CC0 已经足够。
CC0 is usable for software and is the most burden-free choice: no attribution, no copyleft, commercial use allowed, closed-source derivatives allowed. If you later want stronger judicial enforceability (in some jurisdictions a "waiver" is less certain than a "grant"), consider MIT or Unlicense; but as a statement of "completely open, zero friction for users", CC0 is sufficient.